OL,3,GNEWSAGroom seeks helicopter from
OL,4,Awedding to play at Lord's
OL,5,
OL,6,FA groom is trying to secure a
OL,7,Fhelicopter ride so he can play in a
OL,8,Fdream cricket match at Lord's
OL,9,Fimmediately after his wedding in North
OL,10,FWales.
OL,12,FPeter Melhuish, from Guildford in
OL,13,FSurrey, is due to play at Lord's on 6
OL,14,FSeptember for his club Blackheath after
OL,15,Fthey made it to the final of the
OL,16,FCawston Press Village Cup.
OL,18,FBut the team captain is marrying his
OL,19,Ffiancee, Izzy Upton, in North Wales
OL,20,Fless than 24 hours earlier.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
